{"4120090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashbound: Crown of Sin", "steam_appid": 4120090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/9f786b76f4c025d970724ed25c003dbe.poster.avif?t=1787685200\" width=1170 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/9f786b76f4c025d970724ed25c003dbe.webm?t=1787685200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/9f786b76f4c025d970724ed25c003dbe.mp4?t=1787685200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Intense and Satisfying Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience precision-based battles through a fast, responsive combat system where every encounter feels like an epic duel. Chain your strikes with explosive spells, blend close and ranged attacks seamlessly, and unlock new abilities to refine your own fighting style in a system that rewards timing, aggression, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defy the Corruption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Envoy rules a dying world, twisting faith into control and life into obedience. Everything here wants you dead; the corrupted, the devout, and the forsaken alike. Defy his will, cut through the decay, and rise against the darkness consuming what’s left of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Fallen World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the remnants of a dying realm, a world scarred by corruption and war, where every region tells its own story of survival and decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new enemies and powerful foes across the ruined lands, each guarding secrets buried beneath the ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet wanderers, mercenaries, and survivors walking the same path. Stand together against a world that wants you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unforgiving land, every step is a battle for survival.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/9f786b76f4c025d970724ed25c003dbe.poster.avif?t=1787685200\" width=1170 height=236 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/9f786b76f4c025d970724ed25c003dbe.webm?t=1787685200\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/extras/9f786b76f4c025d970724ed25c003dbe.mp4?t=1787685200\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master Intense and Satisfying Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience precision-based battles through a fast, responsive combat system where every encounter feels like an epic duel. Chain your strikes with explosive spells, blend close and ranged attacks seamlessly, and unlock new abilities to refine your own fighting style in a system that rewards timing, aggression, and control.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Defy the Corruption</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Envoy rules a dying world, twisting faith into control and life into obedience. Everything here wants you dead; the corrupted, the devout, and the forsaken alike. Defy his will, cut through the decay, and rise against the darkness consuming what’s left of humanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore a Fallen World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the remnants of a dying realm, a world scarred by corruption and war, where every region tells its own story of survival and decay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face new enemies and powerful foes across the ruined lands, each guarding secrets buried beneath the ash.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet wanderers, mercenaries, and survivors walking the same path. Stand together against a world that wants you dead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this unforgiving land, every step is a battle for survival.</p>", "short_description": "An isometric action-adventure set in a dark, war-torn world, featuring intense, fluid combat built around player mastery. Master fast, demanding encounters, forge alliances, and defy the corruption consuming what remains of humanity.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese, Japanese, Russian, Turkish, French, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Portugal, Ukrainian, Portuguese - Brazil, German, Italian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/653c331cbfb1e74e320ca63640d7acb8f0b812a4/header.jpg?t=1787685200", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/0b37f748d9eb33a1075b240f55542cc3211c49ad/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787685200", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4120090/0b37f748d9eb33a1075b240f55542cc3211c49ad/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787685200", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9600K or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2070 or AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 30000 MB available space<br></li><